    "created_at": "2026-08-13T13:33:43Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-08-13T13:33:43Z",
    "body": "Because the values end up exposed. Also, I somewhat doubt that changing the colors for links would be web-compatible and this change would remove the only mention of the values that you'd need to implement. That does not seem good.\r\n\r\nI also don't think the test coverage for this is good. It tests the system colors against `<a>`, but if `<a>` also uses the system colors it's just circular.",
